  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SADC Green Bonds</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Accelerate the take-up of green bonds as a tool for SADC member countries to tap into domestic and international capital markets to finance green projects and assets. The project will; support development of listing guidelines and regulations for green bonds, support a pipeline of potential issuers, engage the institutional investment community, undertake training/capacity building of various stakeholders on climate finance and support the adoption and/or enhancement of climate-related financial reporting/disclosures.</narrative>
  </description>
